  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nIn the spec([HTML Standard (whatwg.org)](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/dnd.html#dndevents)), the dropEffect in the table should refer to visual effect, and not the attribute.\r\nFor example, a web author might set dropEffect to “move” but the visual effect should still be none in case of drag/dragstart event.",
